{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年63歲的前TVB小生黃德斌近年雖離巢發展，憑《大叔的愛》及多部電影、舞台劇再創事業高峰，但私下作風依然低調親民。</p><p>熱愛運動的他近年迷上新興運動匹克球（Pickleball），日前更北上廣州切磋球技，意外被網民野生捕獲，其凍齡狀態隨即在網上</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:24:00.557625+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:01:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T11:17:17.642304+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:17:17.642304+00:00","content_hash":"6bf6294b6d7a280c6ee5a4b3a1e6d1475e8991405214680ed886a6bdd0dc90dd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}